PROVISIONAL LICENCE DECISION — NOT YET AN EFFECTIVE OPEN-SOURCE GRANT

The intended licence for original source code in this repository is the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (SPDX identifier: Apache-2.0).

Legal and ownership confirmation is still required. Until the repository owner
replaces this notice with the complete Apache-2.0 licence text and updates the
package metadata, the project remains UNLICENSED and no permission is granted
beyond rights that apply by law.

Proposed licence text: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Reason for the provisional choice: Apache-2.0 is permissive, includes an
express patent grant, and is suitable for the intended open-source local-first
product. This statement is a project decision record, not legal advice.
